# 55QNED85TUA, the US 55-inch QNED85: the models DB lists it for this OTA ID (W24H 33.31.68.01).
# The default board (board_cmdline in guest/targets/soc/), from W24H's own generators
# (host/tools/research/model-config.py, 23.23.30 and 33.31.68 agree): hw-option-gen decodes K24,
# countryType US, 2G, LCD, UD, EPI, 60 Hz panel and SoC output, 1920x1080 graphics; nyx-option-gen
# ATSC. countryGrp 2: configd's USA RMM grpCode. tvregion ATSC: the broadcast system. chip=K24 is
# the literal of W24H's U-Boot (boot.pak). ToolOpt: LLS's factory default record of this line,
# with the QNED85/55" panelInch and toolType of the firmware's factory tables. Identity
# placeholders are replaced per VM.
ethaddr=02:00:00:12:34:56
devtmpfs.mount=1
countryGrp=2
modelopt=000000000
hwopt=500200000004002000
ToolOpt=34755406:1323030:1673241:65:3679539:1395707651
modelName=55QNED85TUA
debugMode=3
serialNum=000RAXX00001
chip=K24
tvregion=ATSC
emmc_size=0x1d2000000
cmdEnd
